1. INSTITUTIONAL & PORTFOLIO PURPOSE:
   This repository contains the sanitized architectural reference, source code,
   and database DDL schema of the Big Data Binops (BDB) platform, engineered by
   Eko Agung (@omeko11). Official operational deployment rights are granted to
   the Indonesian National Police (Polri / Bareskrim Polri). Public visibility
   is provided strictly for software engineering portfolio evaluation,
   architectural review, and academic reference.

2. PROHIBITIONS:
   This software is NOT licensed under an open-source commercial license.
   Unauthorized copying, commercial redistribution, sublicensing, or
   impersonation of official Indonesian National Police (Polri) systems is
   strictly prohibited and subject to applicable laws of the Republic of
   Indonesia.
